---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '@/components/PageHero.astro';
import { buildGraph, breadcrumbSchema, webPageSchema } from '@/lib/schema';
import { SITE } from '@/lib/site';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | ChiroCandy';
const description =
  'How ChiroCandy collects, uses, and protects personal data on chirocandy.com, including contact forms, analytics, and strategy-call requests.';
const url = `${SITE.url}/privacy-policy/`;
const schema = buildGraph(
  webPageSchema({ url, name: title, description, dateModified: '2026-08-25' }),
  breadcrumbSchema([
    { name: 'Home', url: `${SITE.url}/` },
    { name: 'Privacy Policy', url },
  ])
);
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={url} schema={schema}>
  <PageHero
    title="Privacy Policy"
    answer="ChiroCandy Marketing, LLC operates chirocandy.com. This policy explains what data we collect, why we collect it, and how you can request access or deletion."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Our website address is https://chirocandy.com. ChiroCandy Marketing, LLC is a growth company for chiropractic and healthcare practices, founded in 2015.</p>
      <h2>What personal data we collect and why</h2>
      <h3>Strategy call and contact forms</h3>
      <p>
        When you request a strategy call or contact us, we collect your name, practice name, email address, and preferred time. We use that information only to schedule and follow up on your request.
      </p>
      <h3>Comments</h3>
      <p>
        If comments are enabled, we collect the data shown in the comment form, plus IP address and browser user agent string to help with spam detection.
      </p>
      <h3>Cookies and analytics</h3>
      <p>
        We use necessary cookies so the site works. Analytics and ads cookies (Google Tag Manager and the Meta pixel) load only after you accept the cookie banner. You can reject those cookies, change your choice later from Cookies in the footer, or control cookies in your browser.
      </p>
      <h3>Embedded content</h3>
      <p>
        Pages may include embeds such as Vimeo or YouTube. Those third parties may collect data as if you visited their site directly.
      </p>
      <h3>Marketing planning calculator</h3>
      <p>The calculator asks for practice-level budgets, conversion assumptions, and collection amounts. Its calculation code runs in your browser and does not submit those entries to a ChiroCandy form or account. No email is required to calculate or print a scenario. Site analytics and third-party services remain subject to the cookie and embedded-content practices above.</p>
      <p>Do not enter patient names, contact details, diagnoses, or medical records into the calculator. If you choose to book a call, the scheduling process is separate.</p>
      <h2>How long we retain data</h2>
      <p>
        Contact-form submissions are retained as long as needed to serve the inquiry and meet legal or accounting requirements. You can request deletion of personal data we hold about you, except data we must keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.
      </p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can request an export or deletion of personal data we hold about you. Contact {SITE.email} or call {SITE.phoneDisplay}.
      </p>
      <h2>Website privacy and client systems</h2>
      <p>This page describes chirocandy.com. Patient-related workflows for a client practice may involve different systems, vendors, and agreements. Discuss those requirements with our team before sharing patient information. A website privacy statement is not a certification of every client system or integration.</p>
      <p><a href="/faqs/#privacy-and-responsibility">Read privacy-related FAQs</a> or <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>contact us about your workflow</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
